tuple "list"

\end_inset

 contains ten hierarchic models:
 One target-to-criterion model comprised of nine elements;
 and nine criterion-to-alternative models,
 each with three elements.
 Consequently,
 
\begin_inset Formula $\binom{9}{2}=36$
\end_inset

 element pairs must be considered for the target-to-criterion model.
 Each criterion-to-alternative model entails 
\begin_inset Formula $\binom{3}{2}=3$
\end_inset

 element pairs.
 Each element pair corresponds to an edge for the graph by which the hierarchy model is represented.
\end_layout

