key "Zeng2025"
literal "false"

\end_inset

 considered.
 Practically,
 one normalizes —
 standardizes to a scale in 
\begin_inset Formula $\left[0,\,1\right]$
\end_inset

 —
 the measurements to which priority vectors are applied.
 A series of calculations including entropy leads to an emprically-based priority vector.
\end_layout

\begin_layout Standard
